===persian===

گفتی...
در این شب تاریک
تا آمدن تو در پنجره چراغ بیاویزم...
من آوازم را
همچون چراغ
در جانِ پنجره خواهم آویخت،
بی‌ترس از باد
و نگاهِ بد...
آوازِ من خاموش نخواهد شد
آواز من شکسته‌تر از آن است
که باز هم بشکند...
۱۳۶۹/۶/۳

===machine===

You said...
in this dark night
hang a lamp in the window until you come...
I will hang my song
like a lamp
in the soul of the window,
unafraid of the wind
and of the evil eye...
My song will not be put out —
my song is more broken than
could ever break again...
1369/6/3

===lantern===

You said:
in this dark night
hang a lamp in the window until I come...
So I will hang my song there
like a lamp
in the very soul of the window,
with no fear of the wind
or of the evil eye...
My song will not be put out.
My song is already more broken
than anything that could break again...

1369/6/3

